   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Owen. You're verified.\n\nI checked order Q-7601 from Pho Real. The courier handed off the order at 6:41 PM, and there are no earlier refunds or credits on it. The order had two beef pho at $15.00 each, and only one arrived. Since you're reporting it within 48 hours, I can compensate the missing pho in one of two ways:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. This is the $15.00 price minus $3.00, the pho's share of your WELCOME10 promo discount.\n2. **Account credit:** $18.00. This is the $15.00 price plus 20%, usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
