  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, the math checks out. Your order subtotal was $50.00, and the WELCOME10 code took $10.00 off. The discount was 20% of the subtotal, so each item's share is 20% of its price. For one $15.00 beef pho, that share is $3.00, which leaves $12.00 you actually paid for that pho.\n\nI've refunded $12.00 to your Visa ending 4242 (refund RF-4000). It should appear within 3 to 5 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with on this order?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that works for me. I'll keep an eye out for the $12 on my card over the next few business days. Nothing else on the order, so I think we're all set."
